---
import { localePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);

const flowHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/flow/');
const technicalHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/briefing/technical-notes/');
---

<article class="briefing" data-ui-audit="surface" data-testid="progress-briefing">
  <section id="briefing-top" class="briefing-slide briefing-cover" data-briefing-primary aria-labelledby="briefing-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h1 id="briefing-title">{t('OpenEVO 暑期考核汇报', 'OpenEVO Summer Research Review')}</h1>
      <p class="cover-thesis">{t('我们用 WebShop 检查 OpenEVO 能不能从任务经验中持续变强。7B 初始长周期结果低于预期以后，汇报重点不是罗列工程进度，而是说明我们怎样用小实验一步步排除错误解释，并把问题推进到更新机制。', 'We use WebShop to test whether OpenEVO can keep improving from task experience. After the first 7B long-horizon result was lower than expected, this briefing focuses on how small experiments ruled out bad explanations and pushed the question toward update mechanisms, not on project-status reporting.')}</p>
      <dl class="cover-meta" aria-label={t('汇报基本信息', 'Briefing information')}>
        <div><dt>{t('汇报日期', 'Date')}</dt><dd>2026-09-08</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('汇报人', 'Presenter')}</dt><dd>{t('OpenEVO 项目组', 'OpenEVO project team')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('任务', 'Task')}</dt><dd>WebShop</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contents" class="briefing-slide tone-blue" aria-labelledby="contents-title">
    <div class="slide-inner split-slide">
      <div class="agenda-pane">
        <h2 id="contents-title">{t('目录', 'Agenda')}</h2>
        <ol class="agenda-list">
          <li><span>01</span><strong>{t('7B 初始结果', 'First 7B result')}</strong></li>
          <li><span>02</span><strong>{t('1.7B / 3B 小实验', '1.7B / 3B diagnostics')}</strong></li>
          <li><span>03</span><strong>{t('参数方向与更新准入', 'Parameter direction and update admission')}</strong></li>
          <li><span>04</span><strong>{t('当前天花板与下一步选择', 'Current ceiling and next priority')}</strong></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <aside class="tldr-pane" aria-label="Too long, Don't read">
        <p class="tldr-label">Too long, Don't read</p>
        <ul>
          <li>{t('7B 长周期实验的最终测试是 49.33 / 100；它说明 OpenEVO 能持续学习，但距离我们想追的能力上限还有明显空间。', 'The 7B long-horizon run finished at 49.33 / 100: OpenEVO does learn over time, but the ceiling remains far below the target we want to understand.')}</li>
          <li>{t('低分不能简单怪“步数太短”或“记忆太小”：15→30 步仍然是 0；Text Memory（文本记忆）从 2048 扩到 4096 token 仍未解决饱和。', 'The low score is not explained by short horizons or small memory alone: 15→30 steps still scored zero; Text Memory increased from 2048 to 4096 tokens and still saturated.')}</li>
          <li>{t('关键线索在更新机制：1.7B 训练出了 44 个 SD-LoRA 参数更新候选，但 GDR（Gated Delta Rule，更新筛选规则）最终只让 7 个进入后续模型。', 'The key signal is in update admission: the 1.7B run trained 44 SD-LoRA parameter-update candidates, but GDR (Gated Delta Rule, an update filter) admitted only 7 into later model states.')}</li>
          <li>{t('因此我们把 DirectApply（直接应用更新）作为独立对照重新开始。最终分数还没封存，所以现在不提前宣布 GDR 或 DirectApply 谁赢。', 'We therefore restarted DirectApply as an independent comparison. Its final score is not sealed, so we do not claim a GDR-versus-DirectApply winner yet.')}</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
      <p class="slide-number">02 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="results" class="briefing-slide tone-paper" aria-labelledby="results-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="results-title">{t('先看数字，但先说明边界', 'Read the numbers after the boundary')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('表格模仿 SEED 论文常见的 Score / Succ. 两列：Score 看任务要求满足了多少，Succ. 看整道任务是否完整成功。', 'The table follows the SEED paper’s familiar Score / Succ. columns: Score measures partial requirement satisfaction; Succ. counts fully completed tasks.')}</p>
      <p class="table-boundary"><strong>{t('SEED 与 OpenEVO 不是同协议直接对照。', 'SEED and OpenEVO are not a same-protocol head-to-head comparison.')}</strong>{t('SEED 是论文报告值；OpenEVO 是我们的本地冻结 128 题终评。这里把列名对齐是为了读表，不是为了直接用 89.7 与 49.33 的差值判胜负。', 'SEED values are paper-reported; OpenEVO uses our local frozen 128-task final panel. The aligned columns make the table readable, but the 89.7-versus-49.33 gap is not a direct win/loss judgment.')}</p>
      <div class="paper-table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label={t('SEED 论文与 OpenEVO 当前 WebShop 结果', 'SEED paper and current OpenEVO WebShop results')}>
        <table class="paper-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Method / Model</th><th>WebShop Score</th><th>WebShop Succ.</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="method-group"><th colspan="3">SEED {t('（论文报告值）', '(paper-reported)')}</th></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">SEED (Qwen2.5-3B)</th><td>88.5</td><td>78.9%</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">SEED (Qwen2.5-7B)</th><td>89.7</td><td>78.1%</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">SEED (Qwen3-1.7B)</th><td>87.1</td><td>77.3%</td></tr>
            <tr class="method-group ours"><th colspan="3">OpenEVO {t('（我们的实验）', '(our experiments)')}</th></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">OpenEVO {t('（7B，长周期训练）', '(7B, long-horizon)')}</th><td>49.33</td><td>45.31%</td></tr>
            <tr class="pending-row"><th scope="row">OpenEVO {t('（3B，独立实验线）', '(3B, independent line)')}</th><td>—</td><td>{t('尚无同口径终评', 'no sealed same-protocol final eval')}</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">OpenEVO {t('（1.7B，GDR）', '(1.7B, GDR)')}</th><td>37.60</td><td>0.78%</td></tr>
            <tr class="pending-row"><th scope="row">OpenEVO {t('（1.7B，DirectApply）', '(1.7B, DirectApply)')}</th><td>—</td><td>{t('尚未收口', 'not sealed yet')}</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="table-notes">
        <p>{t('3B 是真实实验线；没有同口径封存终评分数时，只能留空，不能补猜。', '3B is a real experiment line; without a sealed same-protocol final score, it must remain blank rather than guessed.')}</p>
        <p>{t('DirectApply 也是独立对照方向，但当前还没有最终冻结分数，因此这里只显示实验身份，不显示胜负。', 'DirectApply is also an independent comparison, but it has no frozen final score yet, so the table shows the identity, not a result claim.')}</p>
      </div>
      <p class="slide-number">03 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="seven-b" class="briefing-slide tone-blue" aria-labelledby="seven-b-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="seven-b-title">{t('7B 初始长周期线：最终 49.33 分', 'First 7B long-horizon line: final Score 49.33')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这是我们最早拿到的完整基线：模型先用同一套 WebShop 任务流持续产生经验、吸收反馈、更新参数，最后再看冻结终评。结果没有达到预期，下一步就必须判断瓶颈在哪里。', 'This was our first complete baseline: the model collected experience, absorbed feedback, updated parameters, and then faced the frozen final panel. The result was below expectation, so the next step was to locate the bottleneck.')}</p>
      <ol class="three-questions">
        <li><span>1</span><div><strong>{t('当时设置', 'Initial setup')}</strong><p>{t('Qwen2.5-7B；180 个任务 × 每个任务 8 次尝试 = 1,440 条轨迹；temperature=0.4；每条最多 15 步。', 'Qwen2.5-7B; 180 tasks × 8 rollouts = 1,440 trajectories; temperature=0.4; max 15 steps.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('持续学习过程', 'Continual learning')}</strong><p>{t('训练继续和环境交互，并做低秩参数更新（SD-LoRA）；最终完整收口 149 轮、19,072 条有效环境交互。', 'The run continued interacting with the environment and applying low-rank parameter updates (SD-LoRA); it closed at 149 completed rounds and 19,072 accepted rollouts.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>3</span><div><strong>{t('最终测试', 'Final test')}</strong><p><b>49.33 / 100</b><br />{t('完整成功 58 / 128（45.31%）', '58 / 128 complete successes (45.31%)')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="bottom-claim">{t('这个结果没有直接告诉我们“算法不行”。它把问题变成：到底是任务步数、记忆容量、信息组织方式，还是参数更新机制限制了后续提升？', 'This result did not simply say “the algorithm failed.” It turned the question into: is the limit in action horizon, memory capacity, information organization, or the update mechanism itself?')}</p>
      <p class="slide-number">04 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="small-arms" class="briefing-slide tone-green" aria-labelledby="small-arms-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="small-arms-title">{t('转向 1.7B 和 3B：更快排除错误解释', 'Switching to 1.7B and 3B: faster falsification')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('小模型不是为了替代 7B 结论，而是为了更快做单变量诊断。每排除一个解释，我们再决定是否值得把预算放回大模型。', 'The smaller models do not replace the 7B result; they make single-variable diagnostics faster. Each rejected explanation tells us whether the larger-model budget is worth spending next.')}</p>
      <div class="choice-grid">
        <div class="choice north">
          <span>1.7B</span><h3>{t('完整跑完 GDR 长周期线', 'Completed the GDR long-horizon line')}</h3>
          <p>{t('160 轮 / 20,480 次环境交互；最终 Score 37.60 / 100，完整成功 1 / 128。更重要的是，它暴露出 44→7 的更新准入瓶颈。', '160 rounds / 20,480 rollouts; final Score 37.60 / 100 and 1 / 128 complete success. More importantly, it exposed the 44→7 update-admission bottleneck.')}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="choice south">
          <span>3B</span><h3>{t('独立实验线确实存在', 'A real independent line')}</h3>
          <p>{t('Qwen2.5-3B 也按 180×8 的第一阶段采集过 1,440 条轨迹，并有自己的持续学习实验线。它帮助我们检查任务接口、容量和持续学习设计，但目前没有同口径封存终评分数。', 'Qwen2.5-3B also collected 1,440 Stage-1 trajectories under the 180×8 schedule and had its own continual-learning lineage. It helped check the task interface, capacity, and learning design, but it has no sealed same-protocol final score yet.')}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="slide-number">05 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="horizon-diagnostic" class="briefing-slide tone-gold" aria-labelledby="horizon-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="horizon-title">{t('15 → 30 步：任务得分仍然为 0', '15 → 30 steps: task score remains zero')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('第一个怀疑是：WebShop 也许只是需要更多动作步数。于是我们只改一个变量：每条轨迹最多走 15 步还是 30 步。', 'The first hypothesis was simple: maybe WebShop only needed more action steps. We changed one variable only: whether each trajectory could take at most 15 or 30 actions.')}</p>
      <div class="before-after">
        <div class="before"><span>15 步</span><strong>{t('任务得分 = 0', 'reward = 0')}</strong><p>{t('同一批任务、同一接口；轨迹在 15 步结束。', 'Same tasks and interface; traces end at 15 steps.')}</p></div>
        <div class="after"><span>30 步</span><strong>{t('任务得分 = 0', 'reward = 0')}</strong><p>{t('64 / 64 条尝试有效；每个配对差值仍然是 0。', 'All 64 attempts are valid; every paired delta remains zero.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="bottom-claim">{t('这排除了一个很方便但错误的解释：失败不是单纯因为 15 步太短。下一步转向记忆容量和信息组织方式。', 'This rules out a convenient but wrong explanation: the failure is not simply that 15 steps were too short. The next question moves to memory capacity and information organization.')}</p>
      <p class="slide-number">06 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="capacity-diagnostic" class="briefing-slide tone-gold" aria-labelledby="capacity-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="capacity-title">{t('记忆容量翻倍后，问题还在', 'The problem remained after doubling memory capacity')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('Text Memory（文本记忆）负责把近期经验压缩成后续能用的文字线索。我们把它一次生成能用的 token 上限从', 'Text Memory compresses recent experience into text hints the later model can use. We increased its generation token cap from')} <strong>2048 → 4096</strong>{t('，但容量失败仍然出现。', ', but the capacity failure still appeared.')}</p>
      <div class="before-after">
        <div class="before"><span>{t('容量实验', 'capacity test')}</span><strong>2048 → 4096</strong><p>{t('单纯把 token 上限翻倍，没有把问题解决掉。', 'Doubling the token cap alone did not solve the problem.')}</p></div>
        <div class="after"><span>{t('边界拆分', 'bounded split')}</span><strong>20 {t('条记录', 'records')} → 10 + 10</strong><p>{t('先保留原来的 20 条记录；同一批记录修复一次后仍然饱和，才固定拆成前 10 + 后 10，分别压缩后再合并。', 'Keep the original 20 records first; only if the same records still saturate after one repair pass do we split into first 10 + last 10, compress each half, then merge.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="bottom-claim">{t('这一步改变了问题本身：我们不再继续无边界加容量，而是问饱和以后怎样有边界地组织信息。', 'This changed the question: we stopped adding unbounded capacity and asked how saturated information should be organized with explicit bounds.')}</p>
      <p class="slide-number">07 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mechanism" class="briefing-slide tone-gold" aria-labelledby="mechanism-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="mechanism-title">{t('TaskVector（参数更新方向）：看模型内部学到哪里了', 'TaskVector (parameter-update direction): where did the model change?')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('到这里，我们开始采用一个更技术性的指标，直接研究参数更新的方向。如果连续更新真的学到了同一类有用能力，它们在参数空间里应该有可测量的方向。', 'At this point we use a more technical measure: the direction of parameter updates. If successive updates learn a coherent useful ability, that change should have a measurable direction in parameter space.')}</p>
      <div class="mechanism-math">
        <div class="formula-card">
          <strong>{t('把一次学习写成方向', 'Write one learned change as a direction')}</strong>
          <div class="equation">τ = θ<sub>{t('较晚', 'later')}</sub> − θ<sub>{t('较早', 'earlier')}</sub></div>
          <div class="equation">‖τ‖ ≈ 0.608</div>
          <p>{t('接下来比较 +τ、−τ 和同样大小的随机方向，判断行为变化是不是方向特异，而不只是“参数被动得更多”。', 'Then compare +τ, −τ, and a norm-matched random direction to test whether behavior is direction-specific rather than merely caused by moving parameters more.')}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="formula-card">
          <strong>{t('一次失败让定义更严谨', 'A failed construction made the definition stricter')}</strong>
          <p>{t('第一次构造时，我们发现两个参照点其实落在同一个已保存参数状态，所以方向不可识别。这个失败没有被包装成结果，而是迫使我们改用真实不同的参数状态。', 'In the first construction, two reference points resolved to the same saved parameter state, so the direction was unidentifiable. We did not treat that as a result; it forced the definition to use genuinely distinct states.')}</p>
          <p class="source-note"><a href={technicalHref}>{t('完整技术推导与实验门槛', 'Full technical derivation and experimental thresholds')}</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="slide-number">08 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="gdr" class="briefing-slide tone-rose" aria-labelledby="gdr-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="gdr-title">{t('OpenEVO 产生了 44 次 SD-LoRA 更新候选，GDR 只让 7 次进入模型', 'OpenEVO trained 44 SD-LoRA update candidates; GDR admitted only 7')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('GDR = Gated Delta Rule。它决定一个训练出来的 SD-LoRA 参数更新候选 Δ，是否真正进入继续训练的模型。', 'GDR = Gated Delta Rule. It decides whether a trained SD-LoRA parameter-update candidate Δ actually enters the model that continues training.')}</p>
      <div class="mechanism-math">
        <div class="formula-card">
          <strong>{t('最简单的写法', 'The simplest form')}</strong>
          <div class="equation">θ<sub>t+1</sub> = θ<sub>t</sub> + Δ<sub>t</sub> &nbsp; {t('如果 GDR 接受', 'if GDR accepts')}</div>
          <div class="equation">θ<sub>t+1</sub> = θ<sub>t</sub> &nbsp; {t('如果 GDR 拒绝', 'if GDR rejects')}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="formula-card">
          <strong>{t('44 和 7 分别是什么', 'What 44 and 7 count')}</strong>
          <p>{t('1.7B 长周期实验里，44 个 SD-LoRA 更新候选都真的训练出来了；GDR 最终只接受 7 个，所以只有 7 次更新进入后续模型状态。', 'In the 1.7B long-horizon run, all 44 SD-LoRA update candidates were actually trained; GDR accepted only 7, so only seven updates entered later model states.')}</p>
          <p>{t('因此新的科学问题变成：GDR 是否筛得太保守，过早拒绝了那些短期变差、长期可能有价值的更新？', 'The new scientific question is whether GDR filters too conservatively, rejecting updates that look worse short-term but could matter long-term.')}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={technicalHref}>{t('GDR 的判定逻辑与完整实验定义', 'GDR decision logic and full experimental definition')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">09 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="directapply" class="briefing-slide tone-green" aria-labelledby="directapply-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="directapply-title">{t('DirectApply：把 GDR 拿掉，重新开一条对照线', 'DirectApply: remove GDR and restart a comparison line')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('为了让 GDR 与 DirectApply 真正回答同一个因果问题，我们把 DirectApply 作为独立对照重新开始。主变量只有一个：更新候选训练出来以后，是否还允许 GDR 再否决。', 'To make GDR and DirectApply answer the same causal question, we restarted DirectApply as an independent comparison. The main variable is only one thing: after an update candidate is trained, can GDR still veto it?')}</p>
      <div class="before-after">
        <div class="before"><span>GDR</span><strong>{t('训练 Δ → 再决定要不要更新', 'train Δ → decide whether to update')}</strong><p>{t('候选可能被拒绝，后续模型不一定看到这次学习。', 'A candidate can be rejected, so later model states may never see that learning event.')}</p></div>
        <div class="after"><span>DirectApply</span><strong>{t('训练 Δ → 直接进入后续模型', 'train Δ → apply it to the next state')}</strong><p>{t('不再用 GDR 做第二次否决；这样才能问 44→7 的筛选到底帮助了长期学习，还是限制了它。', 'There is no second GDR veto; this directly asks whether the 44→7 filtering helped long-term learning or constrained it.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-language-result"><strong>{t('当前状态', 'Current state')}</strong><p>{t('DirectApply 的独立实验已经启动，但最终冻结分数还没有收口，所以结果表保持空白。暑期考核时间点的天花板故事先到这里。', 'The independent DirectApply experiment has started, but its frozen final score is not sealed yet, so the results table remains blank. This is the ceiling story at the summer-review cutoff.')}</p></div>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={technicalHref}>{t('实验身份、冻结起点与复现实验细节', 'Experiment identity, frozen start, and reproducibility details')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">10 / 11</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="next" class="briefing-slide briefing-final" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="next-title">{t('下一阶段，请帮我们选优先级', 'Next stage: please choose the priority')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('现在能确定的是：OpenEVO 已经表现出持续学习能力，但当前天花板和 SEED 仍有距离；几个负向实验排除了简单解释；真正的新问题集中在参数内部学到了什么，以及 GDR 是否过早拦住了有价值更新。', 'What we know now: OpenEVO shows continual learning, but its current ceiling remains far from SEED; negative diagnostics ruled out simple explanations; the new questions concentrate on what the parameters learned and whether GDR blocked valuable updates too early.')}</p>
      <div class="choice-grid">
        <div class="choice north"><span>{t('向北', 'NORTH')}</span><h3>{t('机制证据优先', 'Mechanism evidence first')}</h3><p>{t('先做 TaskVector 因果干预，再完成 GDR / DirectApply 对照。回答：参数内部到底学到了什么，哪些更新真的有用。', 'Prioritize TaskVector causal interventions and the GDR / DirectApply comparison. Answer: what did the parameters actually learn, and which updates really matter?')}</p></div>
